MLCNP Blueprint
Copyright 2026 Vinícius Matheus Romualdo Santos and contributors

The blueprint composes OpenRASP, OWASP Core Rule Set, NGINX, Kubernetes, Tomcat,
and their base images. The local reference image downloads OpenRASP 1.3.7 from
its official GitHub release and verifies its SHA-256 checksum; the binary is not
stored in this repository. All third-party projects remain governed by their
respective licenses and trademarks. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for details.
